        "@value": "Enter your translation here"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The definition and properties of the Legal Resource class in the CPSV-AP are aligned with the ontology included in \"Council conclusions inviting the introduction of the European Legislation Identifier (ELI)\". For describing the attributes of a Legal Resource (labels, preferred labels, alternative labels, definition, etc.) we refer to the ELI ontology."
      }
    ],
