        "@value": "This could be one language or multiple languages, for instance in countries with more than one official language.\r\n\r\nThe recommended controlled vocabularies for this property is the <a href=\"https://op.europa.eu/en/web/eu-vocabularies/dataset/-/resource?uri=http://publications.europa.eu/resource/dataset/language\">Language</a> Authority Table of the Publications Office."
